  "name": "JetForge",
  "abstract": "Parametric jet engines: from design parameters to gas path, shape, cutaway and flight behaviour",
  "description": "Design an engine by its geometry: fan and compressor stages, burner, turbines and nozzle, plus a separate intake part with its own cross-section profile. The mod solves the gas path from those parameters - thrust, specific fuel consumption, spool speeds, surge and choke margins - instead of asking you for a performance curve. Includes a design wizard, a test bench, a cutaway view and a bilingual UI (English and Chinese).",
